Third party components

This license covers the files in this repository only: the compose file,
the scripts, the configuration, and the documentation. The stack pulls
container images of other projects at run time. Those projects keep their
own licenses, and this repository includes none of their code:

  Pi-hole                  EUPL-1.2    https://github.com/pi-hole/pi-hole
  Unbound                  BSD-3-Clause  https://github.com/NLnetLabs/unbound
